## Trust Flow Diagram

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant C as Cursor
    participant T as Trust System
    participant A as Agent
    
    U->>C: Open workspace
    C->>T: Check trust status
    T->>T: Is workspace trusted?
    
    alt Not trusted
        T->>C: Untrusted
        C->>U: Show trust notification
        U->>C: Grant trust OR deny
    else Trusted
        T->>C: Trusted
    end
    
    C->>A: Initialize agent with trust level
    
    alt Untrusted
        A->>A: Restrict to read-only tools
        A->>U: Explain restrictions
    else Trusted
        A->>A: Full tool access
        A->>U: Execute requested operations
    end
```

