## Trust Troubleshooting

### Common Issues

| Issue | Cause | Solution |
|-------|-------|----------|
| Agent can't run commands | Workspace untrusted | Click "Trust workspace" |
| Hooks not executing | Trust revoked | Re-grant trust |
| Agent stuck in Ask mode | Trust level too low | Increase trust level |
| Can't grant trust | MDM policy blocks | Contact IT admin |
| Trust resets on reopen | Trust not persisted | Check `security.workspace.trust.onStart` |

### Diagnostic Commands

```bash
# Check current trust status
# Open Command Palette → "Workspace Trust: Show Trust Status"

# List trusted folders
# Settings → Search "trustedFolders"

# Force trust prompt
# Command Palette → "Developer: Reload Window"
```

